text":"Repeat: Desert Varnish, V7, on go 2."},{"day":58,"min":650,"text":"Onsight: Sandstone Crimps, V8, on go 1."},{"day":58,"min":650,"text":"Dynamic Precision. Power and technique, both real. Cruxes 5% kinder on dyno lines."},{"day":58,"min":650,"text":"Precision Climber. Fingers and technique, both real. Cruxes 5% kinder on technical lines."},{"day":58,"min":660,"text":"Onsight: Powerhouse, V10, on go 1."},{"day":58,"min":660,"text":"Step It Up, done. $14 off the board."},{"day":58,"min":660,"text":"Gas, $32. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":58,"min":845,"text":"He eats like it was a race, and wins."},{"day":58,"min":1020,"text":"You read the same page until it's too dark to read."},{"day":58,"min":1060,"text":"Hazel says the valley gets smaller every year and the climbing gets bigger. Both are true."},{"day":59,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. You're $4 in the hole."},{"day":59,"min":430,"text":"Scout comes back from his rounds with oats in his mouth. Nobody is asking where from."},{"day":59,"min":430,"text":"2 years with Sage, near enough. You celebrate by climbing, which is the only way either of you knows."},{"day":59,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":59,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":59,"min":818,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":59,"min":826,"text":"Gas, $8."},{"day":59,"min":880,"text":"A stamp on your hand, and a nod at the steep end."},{"day":59,"min":888,"text":"Onsight: The Low Roof, V5, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":896,"text":"Onsight: The Pocket Pull, V7, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":904,"text":"Onsight: Lip Service, V6, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":912,"text":"Onsight: Undercut Engine, V7, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":920,"text":"Onsight: Ceiling Crawl, V8, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":928,"text":"Onsight: Stalactite, V9, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":936,"text":"Onsight: Fingertip Cavern, V10, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":936,"text":"Big Week, done. $18 off the board."},{"day":59,"min":936,"text":"Skin in the Game, done. $12 off the board."},{"day":59,"min":944,"text":"Onsight: Heel Hook Grotto, V11, on go 1."},{"day":59,"min":944,"text":"Powerhouse Sender. 40 power lines sent. Big moves are just a Tuesday. Power comes 10% faster."},{"day":59,"min":944,"text":"Gas, $9."},{"day":59,"min":1021,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":59,"min":1061,"text":"Hazel asks how your skin is, then looks at your hands and answers for you."},{"day":60,"min":430,"text":"Van spot, $18. Morning comes anyway."},{"day":60,"min":450,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":60,"min":450,"text":"Gas, $32. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":60,"min":630,"text":"Scout lies exactly at the bottom of your route and does not move until you come down."},{"day":60,"min":670,"text":"The Roadside Shrine again. Still good, if not quite like the first time."},{"day":60,"min":680,"text":"Repeat: Desert Varnish, V7, on go 3."},{"day":60,"min":710,"text":"Twice off the launch. There’s a hueco halfway. New beta: bump through."},{"day":60,"min":740,"text":"You're $2 in the hole. It goes on the card."},{"day":60,"min":740,"text":"Gas, $32. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":60,"min":940,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":60,"min":1060,"text":"A bag of cans to the depot. $8."},{"day":60,"min":1100,"text":"Hazel watches the sparks go up and counts them, out loud, till she loses track at eleven."},{"day":61,"min":440,"text":"Hazel’s driveway. A real bathroom, and coffee in a real mug in the morning."},{"day":61,"min":460,"text":"Ramen again. It works."},{"day":61,"min":460,"text":"You're $1 in the hole. It goes on the card."},{"day":61,"min":460,"text":"Gas, $1."},{"day":61,"min":828,"text":"Six hours on your feet. +$96."},{"day":61,"min":828,"text":"Gas, $32. The van starts on the second try."},{"day":61,"min":1013,"text":"Scout watches you the whole way up, which is more than most belayers manage."},{"day":61,"min":1013,"text":"He is out of the van and gone across the lot inside a minute, and you sit